      "message": "In order for drawPath to convert to drawPoints(lineMode), it needs to make sure the style is stroke since drawPoints forces stroke style. This also adds a small optimization for discarding zero-area filled lines.  Previously these might have been excluded by the clip bounds if they were perfectly horizontal or vertical, but if they were diagonal they would actually just produce a small number of triangles that would have zero-area and never turn into fragments.",
